{"src":"it","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":231300,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"it","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":11303.302694,"text":"Tuttavia, riguardo a questo aspetto, lo spazio Schengen funziona piuttosto come un unico paese."},{"kind":"text","t":11885.934061999998,"text":"However, in this regard, the Schengen area functions rather like a single country."},{"kind":"audio","t":11977.028284999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11981.782518999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11987.051325999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11992.081145999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":11993.186867999999,"samples":11128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":22537.195231,"text":"La grotta poggia sulla sommità di una delle montagne a nord della Mecca, completamente distaccata dal resto del mondo."},{"kind":"text","t":23365.439067000003,"text":"The cave is located on the summit of one of the mountains north of Mecca, completely isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"audio","t":23460.500398,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":23465.816123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23471.048600000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23476.173449,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23481.580613000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23486.096961000003,"samples":31160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":33124.013143,"text":"Oggi tutti scrivono i messaggi sugli schermi dei computer e non hanno mai la necessità di avvicinarsi a un temperamatite."},{"kind":"text","t":33788.702356999995,"text":"These days, everyone types messages on computer screens and never needs to get close to an eraser."},{"kind":"audio","t":33889.202861,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33894.256321,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33899.652115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":33904.581447,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33910.044129999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":33910.582272,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":44042.919032,"text":"I viaggiatori diretti verso paesi con imposte elevate a volte possono risparmiare parecchio, specie su prodotti come gli alcolici e il tabacco."},{"kind":"text","t":44770.242781,"text":"Travelers heading to countries with high taxes can sometimes save a lot, especially on products like alcohol and tobacco."},{"kind":"audio","t":44865.647306,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44871.001631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44876.363906,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44881.552923999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":44886.8267,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":44892.151945,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":44893.7435,"samples":14592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":50699.267513,"text":"Le piante elaborano il proprio nutrimento con il sole"},{"kind":"text","t":51053.859012,"text":"Plants produce their own nutrients using sunlight."},{"kind":"audio","t":51143.074655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51148.373610999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51151.537111,"samples":22664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":310},{"kind":"input","t":55893.995057,"text":"Tramite la fotosintesi. Inoltre fanno ombra."},{"kind":"text","t":56168.692864,"text":"Through photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"audio","t":56241.469017999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56242.241786,"samples":20032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":310},{"kind":"audio","t":56323.207390999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56326.119984,"samples":22432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":62729.509543,"text":"L'ospedale ha seguito il protocollo per il controllo delle infezioni."},{"kind":"text","t":63058.727665,"text":"The hospital followed the protocol for infection control."},{"kind":"audio","t":63147.82386,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63152.813421,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63157.731362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"audio","t":63157.996908,"samples":696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":67843.248473,"text":"compreso l'isolamento del paziente, per evitare che altri possano infettarsi."},{"kind":"text","t":68281.166718,"text":"including isolating the patient to prevent others from getting infected."},{"kind":"audio","t":68373.466302,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68378.320315,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68383.638261,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68387.919513,"samples":28896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":79586.286443,"text":"L'attività svolta è stata per lo più teorica, ma il programma è stato scritto per simulare i rilievi effettuati della galassia del Sagittario."},{"kind":"text","t":80393.250028,"text":"The work carried out was mostly theoretical, but the program was designed to simulate the actual observations of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"audio","t":80497.080189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80502.467384,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80507.613122,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80512.911948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80518.218994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80523.606048,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80529.003382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":80529.30669699999,"samples":2824,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":86988.79220499999,"text":"Nella città di Barcellona le lingue ufficiali sono il catalano e lo spagnolo."},{"kind":"text","t":87483.339351,"text":"In the city of Barcelona, the official languages are Catalan and Spanish."},{"kind":"audio","t":87575.680055,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87580.67053599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87586.181978,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87591.357246,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":87591.646522,"samples":1528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":92000.889359,"text":"All'incirca metà della popolazione preferisce parlare il catalano."},{"kind":"text","t":92380.52975,"text":"About half of the population prefers to speak Catalan."},{"kind":"audio","t":92464.813432,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92470.260085,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":92475.51794199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":840},{"kind":"audio","t":92475.807757,"samples":1896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":99158.125386,"text":"La stragrande maggioranza è in grado di comprenderlo. Lo spagnolo è conosciuto praticamente da tutti."},{"kind":"text","t":99554.682108,"text":"The vast majority are able to understand it. Spanish is known by practically everyone."},{"kind":"audio","t":99647.104461,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99652.38118699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99656.032759,"samples":25664,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":420},{"kind":"audio","t":99727.486414,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99732.942057,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":99734.559312,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":107179.48761,"text":"In certe zone è sufficiente far bollire l'acqua per un minuto, in altre occorrono molti minuti."},{"kind":"text","t":107898.813667,"text":"In some areas, it’s sufficient to boil water for a minute, while in others many minutes are required."},{"kind":"audio","t":107998.58521199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108003.720531,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108009.153444,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":108014.45081,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108020.028982,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":108020.47278499999,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":115573.218201,"text":"Le piante danno il loro meglio quando si trovano nel loro ambiente naturale."},{"kind":"text","t":115999.173396,"text":"Plants perform best when they are in their natural environment."},{"kind":"audio","t":116092.684771,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116098.152934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116103.46153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"audio","t":116103.766495,"samples":3096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":124460.748039,"text":"Quindi resistete alla tentazione di prenderne anche solo un esemplare."},{"kind":"text","t":124869.861752,"text":"So resist the temptation to take even just one specimen."},{"kind":"audio","t":124954.733154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124959.971921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124965.302327,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":124965.911437,"samples":9096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":134546.985595,"text":"Negli anni venti, gli atteggiamenti prevalenti di gran parte dei cittadini"},{"kind":"text","t":135067.9018,"text":"In the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens"},{"kind":"audio","t":135153.156672,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135158.157202,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":135163.575835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135166.483728,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":139556.306305,"text":"e delle nazioni erano il pacifismo e l'isolamento."},{"kind":"text","t":139993.02804,"text":"And the attitudes of nations were pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"audio","t":140078.293602,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140083.52337799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140088.779824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":140090.26397,"samples":14496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"input","t":148493.57296,"text":"Il mosasauro era il super predatore della sua era e per questo non temeva nulla, se non gli altri mosasauri."},{"kind":"text","t":149303.478909,"text":"The mosasaur was the ultimate predator of its era, and for that reason it feared nothing except other mosasaurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":149398.841169,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149404.194883,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149409.531128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149414.697395,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149419.947501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149424.487268,"samples":31160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":162136.551344,"text":"Fin dalla fondazione di Asunción, avvenuta nel 1537, il Paraguay è stato in grado di mantenere gran parte della sua identità e delle sue peculiarità autoctone."},{"kind":"text","t":162951.773578,"text":"Since its founding in 1537, Paraguay has been able to preserve much of its identity and indigenous characteristics."},{"kind":"audio","t":163061.37336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163067.082148,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163071.97851,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163077.363144,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163082.515231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":163087.692038,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163090.407934,"samples":28392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":172004.278234,"text":"I maiali sono portatori della malattia che successivamente viene trasmessa all'uomo tramite le punture di zanzare."},{"kind":"text","t":172615.396771,"text":"Pigs are carriers of the disease, which is later transmitted to humans through mosquito bites."},{"kind":"audio","t":172710.293529,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172713.462058,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":172716.810385,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172720.079092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172722.73804999999,"samples":30328,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":183211.736585,"text":"La maggior parte dei moderni telescopi destinati alla ricerca sono enormi strutture in zone sperdute, dove le condizioni atmosferiche sono favorevoli."},{"kind":"text","t":183909.204957,"text":"Most modern telescopes used for research are enormous facilities located in remote areas where the weather conditions are favorable."},{"kind":"audio","t":184014.198293,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184019.38272,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":184024.909511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184030.390763,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184035.512881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":184040.815296,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184045.808906,"samples":32592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":192007.396251,"text":"Molte persone non si immaginavano pazienza e consapevolezza fossero necessarie anche per chi rientra in patria."},{"kind":"text","t":192590.272551,"text":"Many people didn’t realize that patience and awareness were also necessary for those returning home."},{"kind":"audio","t":192681.513818,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192686.947951,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192691.925711,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192697.21526599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192702.840576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":192703.14230099999,"samples":4760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":199683.19445,"text":"probabilmente quindi la notazione è stata apposta solo come un'etichetta"},{"kind":"text","t":200096.682537,"text":"So probably the notation was just added as a label."},{"kind":"audio","t":200179.761845,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200181.30081,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200182.812356,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":200183.096671,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":207672.128956,"text":"Eppure gli uccelli hanno molte caratteristiche che li accomunano ai dinosauri."},{"kind":"text","t":207996.098669,"text":"Yet birds share many characteristics with dinosaurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":208079.45804199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208084.722368,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208089.293095,"samples":31664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":219743.532269,"text":"Si tratta principalmente di spiagge sabbiose, sicure per il nuoto e la maggior parte di esse gode dell'ombra degli alberi di Poutukawa."},{"kind":"text","t":220525.86067999998,"text":"They are mainly sandy beaches, safe for swimming, and most of them enjoy the shade of Poutukawa trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":220613.474555,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":220614.894222,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":220616.367618,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":220618.009842,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":220619.726244,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":220620.204417,"samples":16160,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":227760.046052,"text":"Duval, sposato con due figli adulti, non ha destato un grande interesse in Miller."},{"kind":"text","t":228370.614469,"text":"Duval, married with two adult children, did not arouse much interest in Miller."},{"kind":"audio","t":228461.749737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":228466.937194,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":228472.011632,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":228477.293448,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":228477.948827,"samples":10528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":230965.561506,"text":"a cui ha raccontato la storia."},{"kind":"text","t":231253.425948,"text":"to whom he told the story."},{"kind":"audio","t":231324.97583,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":231325.728088,"samples":26632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"close","t":241405.051465,"code":1005}]}